cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "thesis-refinery"
abstract: >-
  A build and verification toolchain for an already-written thesis: markdown
  sources are rendered to .docx, a declarative style specification is applied by
  scripts, and independent assertions fail the build when the document drifts.
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pseudosalieri/thesis-refinery"
url: "https://github.com/Pseudosalieri/thesis-refinery"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
keywords:
  - thesis
  - dissertation
  - docx
  - reproducibility
  - formatting
  - verification
authors:
